add='''### Compound Format

Pass `compound: true` to break a duration into multiple units, largest first. Zero-valued units are skipped, units run from days down to seconds, and any leftover milliseconds are dropped. `compound` takes precedence over `long`.

```ts
ms(5400000, { compound: true })       // "1h 30m"
ms(90061000, { compound: true })      // "1d 1h 1m 1s"
ms(-5400000, { compound: true })      // "-1h 30m"
ms(999, { compound: true })           // "0s"
```

'''
